message: >-
  If you use this software or database structure, please cite it using the
  metadata below. Note: this repository currently contains no factual incident
  data; it is the evidence-management foundation only.
title: "Turkey Mining & Quarrying Accidents Database (foundation)"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-07-13"
abstract: >-
  Evidence-management foundation for a database of fatal mining and quarrying
  accidents in Türkiye (2010-present): schema, controlled vocabularies,
  claim/decision review model, quality checks, and public-export machinery.
authors:
  - name: "Turkey Mining Accidents Project"
keywords:
  - occupational safety
  - mining
  - Türkiye
  - data journalism
